This event celebrates 19 million downloads of [[Nyanko Daisensou]] starting from July 30th, 2015 (11:00), until August 15th, 2015 (10:59)

==Event==
*'''Campaign 1: Introduce the new Ultra Souls'''
The sixth Ultra Souls Cat - [[Kachi-Kachi (Uber Rare Cat)|Kachi Kachi]] - was added since this event and a [[Guaranteed Uber Rare Cat Campaign]]. If the [[Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS (Gacha Event)|Ancient Heroes Ultra Souls]] does not appear, players need to update Nyanko Daisensou app to latest version (4.1.0)

Event Period:July 30th, 2015 (11:00) to August 3rd, 2015 (10:59)
*'''Campaign 2: Monthly Event Revival'''
High difficulty Stages include Enemies appear in Past Events, one more Stage has been added.
*'''Campaign 3: Time-limited Characters appeared!'''
[[Gold Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Gold Cat]], [[Neneko (Super Rare Cat)|Neneko]], [[Cat Base Mini (Super Rare Cat)|Cat Base Mini]] and the new [[Metal Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Metal Cat]] available in the Rare Cat Capsule/Gacha for a limited time.
*'''Campaign 4: 20 Million DL Stage appeared!'''
A new timed stage [[Joy of 20 Million!|20 Million Downloads Special Gift!]] appears during this event, with Silver Ticket, Rare Ticket,... as bonus gift.
*'''Campaign 5: [[Deadly Carnival!]] '''
High difficulty Stages are hybrid of [[:Category:Cyclone Stages|Cyclone Stages]] and [[:Category:Awakening Stages|Awakening Stages]].
*'''Campaign 6: XP Stage and Treasure Festival'''
[[XP Stage]] appears everyday and [[Treasure Festival]] (Main Chapter 1, 2 and 3 only)
*'''Campaign 7: Cat Food Gift'''
The players can earn 20 Cat Food everyday as a login bonus.

